        "text": "<https://archive.org/details/akkartik-freewheeling-2025-01-19-debug|4-minute video> update on my \"Emacs for visualizing L\u00d6VE apps\": it no longer looks very much like Emacs at all. I think all it shares with Emacs is a flat namespace of handler functions that you can compose to create windows with different experiences around shared data.\n\n<https://futureofcoding.slack.com/archives/C03RR0W5DGC/p1736209328833849|Previously.>",
